 "text": "Menominee County\nGovernment\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nEmployment\nForms & Documents\nMunicipalities\nServices\nDepartments\n9-1-1 (Central Dispatch)\nAdministration\nBuilding Codes\nClerk\nCounty Board of Commissioners\nCounty Fair\nCourts\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nLand Information Services (GIS)\nMenominee County Library\nMenominee Regional Airport\nParks & Recreation\nProsecuting Attorney\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCommunity\nArea Information\nCUPPAD\nM & M Regional Guide\nMenominee Conservation District\nMenominee County 4-H\nMichigan Department of Health & Human Services\nMichigan State University - Extension\nNorthpointe Behavioral Health\nPublic Health - Delta & Menominee Counties\nUPCAP - Upper Peninsula Commission for Area Progress\nMore\nCalendar\nContact Us\nEmail Alerts\nFAQ\nLinks\nNews\nStaff Directory\nHelpful Quick Links\nWelcome to Menominee County — a place where natural beauty, strong communities, and dedicated public service come together to create an exceptional quality of life.\nLocated along the shores of Lake Michigan in Michigan's Upper Peninsula, Menominee County is proud of its rich history, vibrant local communities, and abundant outdoor recreation opportunities. From scenic waterfront views and forests to thriving neighborhoods and local businesses, our county offers something for residents, visitors, and businesses alike.\nDepartments\nNews\nMore News\nJan. 15, 2026\n|\nUpdate your Business / School Contact Information with 9-1-1 |\nEvents\nFull Calendar\nOct. 22, 2026 @ 1:30 pm\n|\nLocal Emergency Planning Committee (LEPC): Menominee County ISD |\n|\nOct. 27, 2026 @ 5:30 pm\n|\nCounty Board |\n|\nNov. 2, 2026 @ 5 pm\n|\nParks and Recreation Committee |\nCopyright © 2026 Menominee County\nGovernment - Menominee Michigan\nMenominee County Courthouse\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee, MI 49858\n(906) 863-7779\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy Notice\nA